# Dashes

Project rule ([reference/13_punctuation.md](../reference/13_punctuation.md)): use only ASCII `-` (U+002D).

Never write U+2013 (en dash) or U+2014 (em dash) in Markdown, Python, JavaScript, UI strings, comments, or templates. Replace ranges and breaks with hyphen: `02-07`, `A - B`.
